  unitName: Bolt Master Rahgan
  unitId: 40665
  unitNumber: 1148
  description: An instructor of the Toltya School of Martial Arts. Though Rahgan
    tried everything he could to prevent the God Army from reaching the school, eventually
    the enemy got close enough to burn the entrance to the dojo. Mad with rage as
    he watched his pupils die before him, the few who survived had to force him to
    flee for his own sake. After having found refuge, Rahgan began a period of silent
    recovery once again, which led his pupils to finally learn the truth. What Rahgan
    had been fighting all this time was not an illness, but the rage that lived within
    him.
  summonDesc: So my real enemy lies within...<br>Well, I still wanna go<br>defeated
    in the heat of battle!
  fusionDesc: Stop worrying!<br>I'm not dead just yet!<br>Ha ha ha...<br>*Cough*
    *cough*
  evoDesc: I feel a little better!<br>Quick, take me to the battlefield.<br>Fighting
    is the best medicine!
  element: 4
  rarity: 5
